sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant N as nginx (port 3000)
    participant RM as Request Manager<br/>(port 8000)

    B->>N: GET /login.html
    N-->>B: serves static files

    B->>N: POST /adk/chat + X-SPIFFE-ID header
    N->>RM: proxy_pass /adk/ → :8080
    RM-->>N: {response, agent, ...}
    N-->>B: {response, agent, ...}
